-w-0 flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden"><p class="typ-caption-1 text-grey-400 mt-6 line-clamp-1" title="Aneeka Gupta">Aneeka Gupta</p><h4 class="typ-h4 text-navy-300 line-clamp-3 first:mt-4" title="What’s Hot: Cotton’s comeback">What’s Hot: Cotton’s comeback</h4><time dateTime="2026-04-24" class="typ-caption-2 text-grey-300">24 April 2026</time><p class="typ-body text-navy-300 line-clamp-3">Cotton has surged to two-year highs, driven by a structural shift from surplus to deficit, Iran-war-related polyester cost pressures, and a surge in speculative positioning. With global output falling ~4%, Chinese supply down 10%, and El Ni&amp;#241;o risk rising, the supply-demand balance is tightening materially.</p><ul class="mt-4 list-none p-0 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Tags"><li class="typ-caption-2 border-grey-100 text-navy-300 inline-flex max-w-full items-center border px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate">Commodities</span></li><li class="typ-caption-2 border-grey-100 text-navy-300 inline-flex max-w-full items-center border px-2 py-1"><span class="truncate">Agricultural Commodities</span></li></ul></div></div></a></div></div></div><div id="product-overview" class="bg-silver-150 scroll-mt-30"><div class="container-layout py-8 lg:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><h3 class="typ-h3">Fund Overview</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row"><template></template><span data-focus-scope-start="true" hidden=""></span><table class="mb-10 h-fit w-full border-collapse text-left" data-rac="" aria-label="Overview Table" id="react-aria-_R_b90na9bsnpfiviknpfivb_" role="grid" tabindex="0" data-collection="react-aria-_R_b90na9bsnpfiviknpfivbH1_" aria-describedby=""><thead role="rowgroup" class="bg-navy-300 text-white" data-rac=""><tr role="row"><th tabindex="-1" data-collection="react-aria-_R_b90na9bsnpfiviknpfivbH1_" data-key="0" id="react-aria-_R_b90na9bsnpfiviknpfivb_-0" role="columnheader" aria-colindex="1" data-react-aria-pressable="true" class="border-grey-100 border-b px