ack\",\"siteSlug\":\"wisdomtree-eu\",\"locale\":\"en-GB\",\"excerpt\":\"Cotton has surged to two-year highs, driven by a structural shift from surplus to deficit, Iran-war-related polyester cost pressures, and a surge in speculative positioning. With global output falling ~4%, Chinese supply down 10%, and El Ni\u0026#241;o risk rising, the supply-demand balance is tightening materially.\",\"heroImage\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"alt\":\"cotton.webp\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-7e7030337f49612b41866f84c9753e7f61efd761-1151x564-webp\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"imageAlt\":\"cotton.webp\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-24T12:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Commodities\",\"Agricultural Commodities\"],\"contributorThumbnails\":[{\"name\":\"Aneeka Gupta\",\"headshot\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"alt\":\"Aneeka Gupta\",\"asset\":{\"_createdAt\":\"2026-04-24T14:06:03Z\",\"_id\":\"image-7db109fc94ae574ef6c937bdbd119a3156438bd7-1024x1024-png\",\"_rev\":\"gIPNh3P3FkrEeWtJqzkRQI\",\"_type\":\"sanity.imageAsset\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-04-24T14:06:03Z\",\"assetId\":\"7db109fc94ae574ef6c937bdbd119a3156438bd7\",\"extension\":\"png\",\"media\":{\"_ref\":\"media-library:mlENc2IMivzo:image-7db109fc94ae574ef6c937bdbd119a3156438bd7-1024x1024-png\",\"_type\":\"globalDocumentReference\",\"_weak\":true},\"metadata\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageMetadata\",\"blurHash\":\"e87,ocI;0M^P}@%1WVIpofxZ5Rs.=_I;EgEMoe$*RkR*E2oe%2NHIp\",\"dimensions\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageDimensions\",\"aspectRatio\":1,\"height\":1024,\"width\":1024},\"hasAlpha\":true,\"isOpaque\":false,\"lqip\":\"$98\",\"palette\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imagePalette\",\"darkMuted\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\",\"background\":\"#59372f\",\"foreground\":\"#fff\",\"population\":0.45,\"title\":\"#fff\"},\"darkVibrant\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\",\"background\":\"#550e28\",\"foreground\":\"#fff\",\"population\":0.21,\"title\":\"#fff\"},\"dominant\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch\",\"background\":\"#e6a885\",\"foreground\":\"#